    {
      "subId": "7614308",
      "subQuestName": "Head toward the moon's core",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7614301",
      "subQuestName": "Head toward the moon's core",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761430101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761430101": {
            "id": "761430101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Our journey has reached its end. She is the key to activating Project Moongazer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430102"
            ]
          },
          "761430102": {
            "id": "761430102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430103"
            ]
          },
          "761430103": {
            "id": "761430103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "An imprint left here by the project's final inheritor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430104"
            ]
          },
          "761430104": {
            "id": "761430104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "She will explain everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430105"
            ]
          },
          "761430105": {
            "id": "761430105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Hey! Hello there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430106"
            ]
          },
          "761430106": {
            "id": "761430106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430107"
            ]
          },
          "761430107": {
            "id": "761430107",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "I'm Nin-Kiggia. You can call me Ninnin. That's what people usually call me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430108"
            ]
          },
          "761430108": {
            "id": "761430108",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "What's your name? Ibni-Belum? Ungien? Maagees? Or are you Lusalim?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430109"
            ]
          },
          "761430109": {
            "id": "761430109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#I'm {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430110"
            ]
          },
          "761430110": {
            "id": "761430110",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Hehe, no need to answer me. Unfortunately, I'm no longer here. This is just a recording.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430111"
            ]
          },
          "761430111": {
            "id": "761430111",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "But if you look at it another way, it's not \"unfortunate\" at all. You're here, and that means the plan was a success — you have inherited our mission.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430112"
            ]
          },
          "761430112": {
            "id": "761430112",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "You must still be very confused about a great number of things, such as — \"Who exactly am I?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430113"
            ]
          },
          "761430113": {
            "id": "761430113",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Let me tell you: You are a new life created through the will of the moon, a crucial part of Project Moongazer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430114"
            ]
          },
          "761430114": {
            "id": "761430114",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "\"And what exactly is this project?\" you must be thinking... Don't worry, I'll get to that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430115"
            ]
          },
          "761430115": {
            "id": "761430115",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "First, please thank the Three Moon Sisters, who permitted our transgression and allowed us to borrow the power of creation from the moon's very origin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430116"
            ]
          },
          "761430116": {
            "id": "761430116",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Secondly, thanks are owed to my teacher, Lusalim. He inherited everyone's research and successfully collated all their ancient moon energy data.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430117"
            ]
          },
          "761430117": {
            "id": "761430117",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "That's how I was able to gather that data in this sea at the moon's core. Then, when the primordial power of creation was triggered... \"Bam!\"—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430118"
            ]
          },
          "761430118": {
            "id": "761430118",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "A cute little black kuuhenki — namely you — was born.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430119"
            ]
          },
          "761430119": {
            "id": "761430119",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "You might inherit the name of someone who came before us through the ocean of data, or you might not, but you will probably recall that you have a mission.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430120"
            ]
          },
          "761430120": {
            "id": "761430120",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So this is how Eggie was born...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430121"
            ]
          },
          "761430121": {
            "id": "761430121",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Next, we must say thank you to Madam Maagees, who uncovered the nature of our astral visitor — a data-based lifeform. Her research was the foundation upon which you were born.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430122"
            ]
          },
          "761430122": {
            "id": "761430122",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "And we have Ungien, who sacrificed his life to relay the final message that our guest's civilization sent out into the stars.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430123"
            ]
          },
          "761430123": {
            "id": "761430123",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Then came the first Moongazer, Ibni-Belum, who led us to the moon, opened our eyes, and tirelessly gazed into the brilliant starry skies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430124"
            ]
          },
          "761430124": {
            "id": "761430124",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Finally, dear successor, thank you as well for your imminent sacrifice, which will activate the final step of our project.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430125"
            ]
          },
          "761430125": {
            "id": "761430125",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Your mission is to continue transmitting the message we once received out into the universe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430126"
            ]
          },
          "761430126": {
            "id": "761430126",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "\"A single ray of light is feeble, easily swallowed by the darkness, but as long as another light shines out before it can fade...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430127"
            ]
          },
          "761430127": {
            "id": "761430127",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "\"Then one day, there will surely come a ray of light that pierces the night like the dawn.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430128"
            ]
          },
          "761430128": {
            "id": "761430128",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "I imagine you understand what I mean at this point, yes? As it happens, my time is almost up... But that's okay. I'll be joining them all soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430129"
            ]
          },
          "761430129": {
            "id": "761430129",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "Come to think of it, you might actually have inherited my name, hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430130"
            ]
          },
          "761430130": {
            "id": "761430130",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Nin-Kiggia's Mark",
            "text": "It's time to say goodbye. Go complete your mission. And lastly... I salute you, and all your fellow Mo{RUBY#[S]starry sky}ongazers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430131"
            ]
          },
          "761430131": {
            "id": "761430131",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "And that's everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430132"
            ]
          },
          "761430132": {
            "id": "761430132",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "All the researchers who once explored the starry sky have had their data merged into this ocean. By the will of the moon, they will be reborn at some point in the future in forms akin to Eggie's.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430133"
            ]
          },
          "761430133": {
            "id": "761430133",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "They will instinctively consume each other to acquire more data until the mission becomes clear in their minds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430134"
            ]
          },
          "761430134": {
            "id": "761430134",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Then they will walk the path we have walked once more, come here, and learn everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430135"
            ]
          },
          "761430135": {
            "id": "761430135",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "They will use themselves as keys to open the Moongazer module in the Eye of Ibni-Belum, and resend the message out into the universe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430136"
            ]
          },
          "761430136": {
            "id": "761430136",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then, they will return to the cycle of life...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430137"
            ]
          },
          "761430137": {
            "id": "761430137",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes, and this cycle may have already happened more than once.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430138"
            ]
          },
          "761430138": {
            "id": "761430138",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That said, calling out into unknown space is not necessarily safe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430139"
            ]
          },
          "761430139": {
            "id": "761430139",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "The dragon researchers must have also realized this, which is why they began work on the Lunar Veil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430140"
            ]
          },
          "761430140": {
            "id": "761430140",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "And in Ninnin's era, the world already teetered on the brink of destruction due to the conflict between two supreme beings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430141"
            ]
          },
          "761430141": {
            "id": "761430141",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But peace has been restored in Teyvat, at least for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430142"
            ]
          },
          "761430142": {
            "id": "761430142",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(If the signal sent out this time ends up drawing the attention of the darkness that dwells amidst the stars to this place...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430143"
            ]
          },
          "761430143": {
            "id": "761430143",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "As promised, I will hand the key and the message over to Ninnin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430144"
            ]
          },
          "761430144": {
            "id": "761430144",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But do you think we should stop her from completing her mission? Or should we support her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430145"
            ]
          },
          "761430145": {
            "id": "761430145",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I need some time to think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430146"
            ]
          },
          "761430146": {
            "id": "761430146",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Mmhmm, I understand. Then let us return to the first Moongazer's tower.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430147"
            ]
          },
          "761430147": {
            "id": "761430147",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What about Paimon and Ninnin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430148"
            ]
          },
          "761430148": {
            "id": "761430148",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Don't worry. Maagees will pick them up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430149"
            ]
          },
          "761430149": {
            "id": "761430149",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "It'll be a fairly long journey. We'll have plenty of time to give this some more thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761430150"
            ]
          },
          "761430150": {
            "id": "761430150",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Let's go. It's time to leave."
          }
        }
      }
    },
